Approvals: Agent

Purpose:
  Defines approval requirements and escalation rules.

ApprovalLevels:
  AUTO:
    No approval required
  AUTO_REWORK:
    Auto-execute, rework on failure
  REVIEW_REQUIRED:
    Human review required after execution
  HUMAN_APPROVAL:
    Human approval required before execution
  EXPLICIT_APPROVAL:
    Explicit human approval with confirmation

ApprovalMatrix:
  R0:
    AUTO
  R1:
    AUTO
  R2:
    AUTO / POLICY
  R3:
    APPROVAL
  R4:
    APPROVAL
  R5:
    EXPLICIT_APPROVAL

Escalation:
  AUTO:
    Execute
  RETRY:
    Retry up to 3 times
  ALTERNATIVE:
    Try alternative approach
  HUMAN_REVIEW:
    Escalate to human

EscalationRules:
  [AP1]  After 3 failed attempts, agent MUST escalate to human.
  [AP2]  Production actions ALWAYS require explicit approval.
  [AP3]  Agent MUST NOT auto-approve actions with data loss risk.
  [AP4]  Agent MUST record approval decision in audit log.

State: +
  